  "title": "Chicken Spaghetti Casserole with Broccoli",
  "description": "Leftover chicken plus pantry staples like canned soup, French-fried onions, and frozen broccoli help this chicken spaghetti casserole come together in just 10 minutes of prep time.",
  "authors": [
    "JENNIFERK2"
  ],
